---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms — PDF Stowaway Scanner"
  description="Terms of use for PDF Stowaway Scanner: a free, open-source tool provided as-is with no warranty."
  pathname="/terms"
>
  <section class="container max-w-2xl py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Terms</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-muted-foreground">
      PDF Stowaway Scanner is provided free of charge, as-is, with no warranty of any kind. It is
      offered to help you spot hidden content in PDF files, but it cannot guarantee that every
      technique for hiding content will be detected, and it is not a substitute for your own
      judgment when reviewing a document.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
      You are responsible for how you use this tool and for any decisions made based on its
      output. The source code is released under the AGPL-3.0-or-later license; see the LICENSE
      file in the project repository for the full terms.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
      These terms may be updated as the project evolves. Continued use of the site after a change
      constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
